# -*- mode: pan -*-
# Pan - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
#   colour     : #cc0000
#   hue        : 0.0 deg
#   layer      : core (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
#   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
#   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

on error resume
    say "Hello World!"
end on error resume
